---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../../../components/Hero.astro';
import Cta from '../../../components/Cta.astro';
import SectionNav from '../../../components/SectionNav.astro';
---
<Base title={"Who Is in the Room When a Community Bank Sells a Hotel Loan"} description={"What the lender, the special assets officer, the chief credit officer, the CFO, the president, the loan committee, and counsel each have on their mind, and what we can say to each."}>
  <Hero eyebrow="For community banks" title={"Who is in the room."} lead={"A loan sale is decided by several people, and each is weighing something different. What each of them needs to hear."} />
  <SectionNav section="communityBanks" />
  <main id="main">
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Seven seats</p><h2>The same loan looks different from each chair.</h2>
        <p>The first column describes what is typically on each person's mind. The second is what we can say to them, and every statement in it restates what this site already says about how we work.</p></div>
      <div class="acc faq">
        <details name="room" open><summary><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">The lender who made the loan</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> The owner is a customer, often for years, with deposits and other credit at the bank. You do not want to blindside the owner, and you do not want to be the one who sold the loan cheaply.</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> We do not contact the borrower, guarantors, the brand, or hotel staff without the bank's consent. After closing we contact the borrower directly, with notice of the transfer and where payments go. The loan documents stay the same, and we prefer an agreed outcome to enforcement.</p></div></details>
        <details name="room"><summary><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">The special assets officer</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> One hotel loan can occupy a credit officer for a year or more, and it comes with a flag, a manager, a license, a payroll, and sometimes a receiver. The rest of the problem list is waiting.</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> We take over the loan, the file, and the workout. The bank's involvement ends on a date it chooses.</p></div></details>
        <details name="room"><summary><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">The chief credit officer</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> Is the recovery better than holding the loan? How will the risk rating and the plan read to the examiners? How is the decision documented?</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> You get a price in writing, with the assumptions behind it, or a plain no within days, with the reason. Diligence is done before we name a figure, and the figure does not move without a reason found in diligence.</p></div></details>
        <details name="room"><summary><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">The CFO</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> The reserve, the charge-off, the carrying value, and the quarter-end. And what the loan costs to hold each month in legal fees, advances, and staff time.</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> A fixed price and a closing date, set in the loan sale agreement. How a loan sale is treated in the bank's accounts is a matter for the bank and its auditors.</p></div></details>
        <details name="room"><summary><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">The president</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> The bank's name in a small market, the borrower's standing in the community, the capital, and getting the problem behind the bank.</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> The bank receives cash at closing. The existence of a discussion is confidential, as is everything in the file.</p></div></details>
        <details name="room"><summary><span class="n">06</span><span class="t">The loan committee and the board</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> Is the price fair? Did we test it? What happens if something goes wrong after closing?</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> A conversation and an indicative price carry no obligation to sell. We provide proof of funds with a bid, and we do not rely on third-party financing to close. We confirm in writing which seat we are in: principal buyer, capital provider, or arranger.</p></div></details>
        <details name="room"><summary><span class="n">07</span><span class="t">The bank's counsel</span><span class="pm"></span></summary><div class="body"><p><strong>On their mind.</strong> The representations, recourse, claims by the borrower, participants' consent, the documents, and what is delivered at closing.</p><p><strong>What we can say.</strong> We sign your confidentiality agreement or provide ours before any loan-level information is shared. At closing the note is endorsed, the mortgage is assigned, and the file is transferred. If the loan carries a government guarantee, we work within the agency's consent requirements. Loans are commonly sold as-is and without recourse, with limited representations, and the terms are negotiated.</p></div></details>
      </div>
      <p class="fine">The concerns described are typical, drawn from general experience of how problem loans are handled, and are not quotations from any person or bank.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="feature"><div class="wrap">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Not in the room, in everyone's mind</p><h2>The examiner.</h2></div>
      <div><p class="lead">Everyone at the table is also thinking about how the risk rating, the plan, and the decision will read at the next exam. A written price with its assumptions, a current valuation, and a documented decision all help.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-light arrow" href="/banks/community-banks/examiners-and-reserves/">Examiners and reserves</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Related reading</p></div><ul class="toc"><li><a href="/banks/community-banks/board-package/">What the memo to the loan committee should cover <span>Community banks</span></a></li><li><a href="/banks/community-banks/borrower-relationship/">When the owner is a customer and a neighbor <span>Community banks</span></a></li><li><a href="/banks/how-a-sale-works/">How a hotel loan sale works <span>Banks</span></a></li></ul></div></section>
  </main>
  <Cta title={"Discuss a hotel loan in confidence."} text={"A conversation and an indicative price carry no obligation to sell."} label={"Start a conversation"} />
</Base>
